docker/seccomp/builder.json

  This file is not part of any Docker image; it ships as part of the action's
  own source and is read by the Docker client on the runner, via the
  `security_opt: seccomp=` entry in docker/compose.action.yaml. It is a
  verbatim copy of moby/profiles' default seccomp profile, re-vendored offline
  by `make seccomp_profile`, with entries appended for the syscalls runc needs
  and that profile refuses at every capability.

  moby/profiles
    License : Apache License 2.0 (Apache-2.0)
    Source  : https://github.com/moby/profiles

